              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man tek ng’atu moko goyo wang’ jamiru pare, kadi wang’ bong’ pare, man enyothe; ebigonye pi wang’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.26",
