          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man tek jung’eyo nia koni dhiang’ ugamu gudo con, e won ugwoke ngo; e ebiculo koni dhiang’ pi koni dhiang’ andha, man lim m’utho bibedo pare gire.",
          "type": "text",
